"An administrator asked to change the address of your account. Cancel it if "
"you did not expect this."
msgstr ""
"Un administrateur a demandé de changer l'adresse de votre compte. Annulez-le"
" si vous ne vous y attendiez pas."

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/email_change.html:26
msgid "Cancel the change"
msgstr "Annuler le changement"

